{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43404","headline":"斑竹簟 · 无名氏","name":"斑竹簟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"龙鳞满牀波浪湿，血光点点湘娥泣。\n一片晴霞冻不飞，深沈尽讶蛟人立。\n百朵排花蜀缬明，珊瑚枕滑葛衣轻。\n闲窗独卧晓不起，冷浸羁魂锦江里。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43404.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43404","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}